# Networking

- Declare `INTERNET` in `AndroidManifest.xml`
- Retrofit interfaces live in `data/api/`; DTOs in `data/model/` with Gson annotations
- Base URL: `https://jsonplaceholder.typicode.com/` via Retrofit builder
- Map failures to user-readable messages in `UiState.Error` (no silent catch blocks)
